  "5": [
    ["Employee categories. The Company classifies employees into two categories as follows."],
    ["Permanent employees", "A permanent employee is an employee engaged by the Company on an ongoing basis without a fixed end date. Permanent status may begin after the employee passes the probation assessment and is appointed, or immediately where probation is not required, in accordance with Company procedures. Wages or salary may be paid monthly, daily or on another basis. Job levels, positions and equivalent grades are determined under Company procedures."],
