  "9": [
    ["Payment date and place: wages, overtime pay, holiday work pay, holiday overtime pay and other employment benefits will be paid at the employee's workplace or transferred to the bank account provided by the employee with consent. Payment is made twice a month, on the 15th and 30th, or as agreed. If a payday falls on a holiday, payment may be moved before or after the scheduled date."],
    ["The Company reserves the right to amend, change, supplement or cancel these regulations and human-resource management procedures as appropriate. Where the Company or an authorised person prescribes otherwise for a particular case, that direction shall be followed."]
