    ["A male or female employee may request this leave, provided the employee's spouse who gave birth is female."],
    ["The leave is counted in calendar days, not working days. Holidays or other leave occurring during the period cannot be excluded to extend the entitlement."],
    ["The employee must submit a leave form, notify the supervisor and request approval. Reliable supporting evidence must include a copy of the marriage certificate showing the relationship and a birth certificate or medical evidence confirming the childbirth. The Company will use the evidence to decide whether to approve the leave."],
    ["Holidays occurring during this leave are included in the leave period."],
    ["The leave may be continuous or non-continuous as necessary and appropriate, but may be used only once for that pregnancy."],
